rd robots that seem to show up at the worst times?!"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"モヤついている高校生・河本カナ。嵐のごとく登場するハル子。その時カナの額にお花が生えた！煙を吐きがら街をぶっ潰すアイロン。毎日が、毎日毎日続いていくと思っていた・・・。力を手に入れたカナはアイロンをぶっ飛ばせるのか！？","tagline":"走れ、出来るだけテキトーに。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lTxQ7diHJqaTfIrDCXjpj46L1Ap.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lTxQ7diHJqaTfIrDCXjpj46L1Ap.png","language":"ja","width":1611,"height":523}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oajMIMCROf3g0CaXvp8NnM25w7B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oajMIMCROf3g0CaXvp8NnM25w7B.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ydBaj31yzVm1XvovCMkONmrchVd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ydBaj31yzVm1XvovCMkONmrchVd.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1KQUBJXo7n0DV5IPFurkiAeCAGp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1KQUBJXo7n0DV5IPFurkiAeCAGp.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ck2Pd1R4Qw26GhILtnNP7QDIhp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ck2Pd1R4Qw26GhILtnNP7QDIhp.jpg","language":"ja","width":848,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eKmfQPGflZfhXpKbElPxfongM6O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eKmfQPGflZfhXpKbElPxfongM6O.jpg","language":"ja","width":848,"height":1272},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xGM7YC6UXXcCYq42EZK6Av9UJdA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xGM7YC6UXXcCYq42EZK6Av9UJdA.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rur4CaVAQNmNMyeOeOBSpKG1QbR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rur4CaVAQNmNMyeOeOBSpKG1QbR.jpg","language":"ja","width":1500,"height":2122},{"type":"poster","url"